00:14:38,972 --> 00:14:42,164
Next section: Common pitfalls.

72
00:14:42,514 --> 00:14:51,850
Mixing Concerns. Don't combine stimulus and checking in the same module/class Don't drive signals from monitor or checker components

73
00:14:52,200 --> 00:15:00,384
Hardcoded Values. Use parameters/constants for timing and configuration Avoid magic numbers in code

74
00:15:00,734 --> 00:15:08,174
Insufficient Checking. Don't rely on manual inspection of waveforms Always implement automatic checking

75
00:15:08,524 --> 00:15:16,060
Poor Error Messages. Include enough context to debug failures Use consistent error message format

76
00:15:16,410 --> 00:15:25,098
Inadequate Documentation. Document component purpose and interfaces Explain complex logic and timing relationships

